<title>USA: Papa John's sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Papa John's sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Papa John's International Inc said its board of directors approved a 3-for-2 stock split.</p>
<p>The company said the stock split will be effective for stockholders of record on Nov. 8 and certificates representing the split shares will be distributed on or about Nov. 22.</p>
</text>
